          "text": "The Lecture Hall – Venue Hire in Central London﻿"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Historic event space for conferences and corporate events in London"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Located in Toynbee Hall’s Grade II listed building, The Lecture Hall combines Victorian character with modern AV facilities – perfect for corporate events, conferences, lectures, receptions and private venue hire in East London. Blending heritage architecture with modern AV facilities, it’s ideal for organisations looking for a memorable and flexible space in the heart of London’s East End."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Explore the Lecture Hall"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Lecture Hall provides a bright, flexible layout with period character and excellent natural light. Ideal for conferences, away days, training sessions, presentations, networking events, or community gatherings."
