          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Discover one of London’s most inspiring historic venues, restored with contemporary technology for a seamless event experience. The Lecture Hall forms part of Toynbee Hall’s beautifully restored Victorian estate – where heritage design meets 21st-century functionality. Discover elegant wood panelling, high ceilings and adaptable staging options that give every event a professional finish."
